Package: causalR
Type: Package
Title: Causal Inference and Target Trial Emulation Toolkit
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Hui", "Ouyang",
    email = "ouyanghui950913@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reusable helpers for observational causal inference and target
    trial emulation (TTE) in clinical research: weight diagnostics,
    clone-censor-weight templates, sensitivity analysis for unmeasured
    confounding, and reporting figures. The repository also carries the
    24-week study materials and the weekly analysis code these functions
    are distilled from.
